  <jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(1) 売上高&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;本邦の外部顧客への売上高が、連結損益計算書の売上高の90％を超えるため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:RevenuesFromExternalCustomersInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(2) 有形固定資産&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;本邦に所在している有形固定資産の金額が、連結貸借対照表の有形固定資産の金額の90％を超えるため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:PropertyPlantAndEquipmentInformationForEachRegionTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachOfMainCustomersTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３．主要な顧客ごとの情報&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;外部顧客への売上高のうち、連結損益計算書の売上高の10％以上を占める相手先はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:InformationForEachOfMainCustomersTextBlock>
